### Ingerir Beta Alimentos (multipart — requer dois arquivos CSV)
# Salve os arquivos abaixo como cabecalho.csv e itens.csv e ajuste os caminhos
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest/beta
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cabecalho"; filename="cabecalho.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

NUMERO_PEDIDO;FORNECEDOR_CNPJ;FORNECEDOR_RAZAO_SOCIAL;EMISSAO;SITUACAO;MOEDA
20260088412;12.345.678/0001-90;Distribuidora Horizonte Ltda;15/08/2026;EM ABERTO;BRL
20260088413;98.765.432/0001-55;Frigorífico Boa Mesa S.A.;01/08/2026;BLOQUEADO;BRL
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="itens"; filename="itens.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

NUMERO_PEDIDO;ITEM;CODIGO_MATERIAL;DESCRICAO;UNIDADE;QTD_PEDIDA;QTD_RECEBIDA;PRECO_UNITARIO
20260088412;1;MAT-77;Óleo de soja 900ml;UN;1.200,000;400,000;6,49
20260088412;2;MAT-78;Açúcar refinado 1kg;UN;500,000;0,000;4,15
20260088413;1;MAT-91;Carne bovina dianteiro kg;KG;2.000,000;0,000;27,90
------Boundary--

# ── 3. PEDIDOS ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### Listar todos os pedidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar pedidos em aberto
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar com saldo pendente
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders?has_pending=true&page_size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por cliente + status + paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders?client_id=alfa&status=open&page_size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Próxima página (substituir cursor pelo next_cursor da resposta anterior)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders?client_id=alfa&status=open&page_size=5&cursor=COLE_O_CURSOR_AQUI
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe de um pedido Alfa
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/alfa/4500001234
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe de um pedido Gama
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-orders/gama/GL-778
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ── 4. CONFERÊNCIAS ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Conferir nota (aprovada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/conferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "alfa",
  "po_number": "4500001234",
  "invoice_number": "NF-99001",
  "vendor_tax_id": "23456789000101",
  "items": [
    { "material": "MAT-1001", "quantity": 40, "total_value": 1836.00 }
  ]
}

### Conferir nota (quantidade excedida)
POST {{baseUrl}}/conferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "alfa",
  "po_number": "4500001234",
  "invoice_number": "NF-99002",
  "vendor_tax_id": "23456789000101",
  "items": [
    { "material": "MAT-1001", "quantity": 999, "total_value": 45855.10 }
  ]
}

### Relatório de conferências rejeitadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/conferences?result=rejected
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Relatório por cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/conferences?client_id=alfa&result=rejected
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ── 5. ADMIN — CLIENTES ──────────────────────────────────────

### Listar clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "epsilon",
  "name": "Epsilon Tecnologia",
  "format_type": "json_nested"
}

### Desativar cliente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/clients/epsilon
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}

# ── 6. ADMIN — USUÁRIOS ──────────────────────────────────────

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "operador1",
  "email": "op1@v360.com",
  "password": "senha1234",
  "role": "operator"
}

### Desativar usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/COLE_O_USER_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}

# ── 7. HEALTH ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
